<title>USA: W.R. Berkley to issue $210 mln securities.</title>
<headline>W.R. Berkley to issue $210 mln securities.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>W.R. Berkley Corp said on Thursday it arranged for the sale of $210 million of 8.197 percent capital securities to be issued by W.R. Berkley Capital Trust, a company-sponsored statutory trust.</p>
<p>The capital securities could be redeemed on or after December 15, 2006. W.R. Berkley said it planned to use substantially all of the net proceeds of the offering to redeem its outstanding classes of preferred stock.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
